&lt;p data-start=&quot;166&quot; data-end=&quot;184&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;166&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;About Clutch&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;186&quot; data-end=&quot;711&quot;&gt;At Clutch, we are reinventing the way Canadians buy and own cars. We had enough of traditional dealerships that took advantage of customers and knew that we could build an incredible car-buying experience while leaving a positive impact on the communities we serve. Recently named one of the Fastest Growing Canadian Companies by the Globe &amp;amp; Mail and one of the Top Canadian Startups by LinkedIn, we’re looking to add to our great team of people who embrace hard things, think like owners, and love to help their teammates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;713&quot; data-end=&quot;1002&quot;&gt;We pride ourselves on our high-quality certified vehicles, great prices, and customer experience. By visiting &lt;strong data-start=&quot;823&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;clutch.ca&lt;/strong&gt;, customers can browse a large selection of high-quality vehicles, buy a car that&#39;s right for them, and enjoy seamless delivery—all from the comfort of their homes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1004&quot; data-end=&quot;1363&quot;&gt;Founded in 2016 and headquartered in Toronto, Clutch services Alberta, British Columbia, Nova Scotia, New Brunswick, Newfoundland, Ontario, Prince Edward Island, and Saskatchewan. We are backed by world-class investors including D1 Capital Partners, Canaan, BrandProject, Real Ventures, Upper90, FJ Labs, Global Founders Capital, and Azure Capital Partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1365&quot; data-end=&quot;1385&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1365&quot; data-end=&quot;1383&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1387&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Vehicle Inspector &lt;/strong&gt;to join our vehicle operations team. In this role, you will inspect and process incoming vehicles, ensuring each car meets Clutch’s high standards before it enters reconditioning or sales. You will document vehicle condition, identify issues, and coordinate with internal teams to maintain a smooth workflow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1740&quot; data-end=&quot;1760&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1740&quot; data-end=&quot;1758&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1762&quot; data-end=&quot;2274&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1762&quot; data-end=&quot;1839&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1764&quot; data-end=&quot;1839&quot;&gt;Inspect incoming vehicles for damage, cleanliness, and mechanical issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1840&quot; data-end=&quot;1918&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1842&quot; data-end=&quot;1918&quot;&gt;Identify and report problems that fall outside Clutch’s quality standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1919&quot; data-end=&quot;1988&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1921&quot; data-end=&quot;1988&quot;&gt;Move, start, and park cars around the lot safely and efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1989&quot; data-end=&quot;2053&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1991&quot; data-end=&quot;2053&quot;&gt;Track inspection results using checklists and digital tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2054&quot; data-end=&quot;2150&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2056&quot; data-end=&quot;2150&quot;&gt;Collaborate with reconditioning, detailing, and mechanical teams to prioritize vehicle flow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2151&quot; data-end=&quot;2210&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2153&quot; data-end=&quot;2210&quot;&gt;Perform basic troubleshooting for minor vehicle issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2211&quot; data-end=&quot;2274&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2213&quot; data-end=&quot;2274&quot;&gt;Keep work areas organized and follow all safety procedures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2276&quot; data-end=&quot;2304&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2276&quot; data-end=&quot;2302&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2306&quot; data-end=&quot;2726&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2306&quot; data-end=&quot;2380&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2308&quot; data-end=&quot;2380&quot;&gt;Strong attention to detail and ability to follow processes accurately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2381&quot; data-end=&quot;2429&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2383&quot; data-end=&quot;2429&quot;&gt;Comfortable working outdoors in all seasons.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2430&quot; data-end=&quot;2482&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2432&quot; data-end=&quot;2482&quot;&gt;Basic knowledge of cars or willingness to learn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2483&quot; data-end=&quot;2545&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2485&quot; data-end=&quot;2545&quot;&gt;Valid G2 or higher driver’s license with a clean abstract.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2546&quot; data-end=&quot;2601&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2548&quot; data-end=&quot;2601&quot;&gt;Able to drive automatic vehicles; manual is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2602&quot; data-end=&quot;2659&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2604&quot; data-end=&quot;2659&quot;&gt;Comfortable using tablets or basic computer software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2660&quot; data-end=&quot;2726&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2662&quot; data-end=&quot;2726&quot;&gt;Reliable, team-oriented, and willing to pitch in where needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2660&quot; data-end=&quot;2726&quot;&gt;Able to commit to a full-time schedule of 40 hours per week, including overtime based on business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2728&quot; data-end=&quot;2746&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2728&quot; data-end=&quot;2744&quot;&gt;It&#39;d be Great if You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2748&quot; data-end=&quot;2932&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2748&quot; data-end=&quot;2822&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2750&quot; data-end=&quot;2822&quot;&gt;Previous experience in automotive, logistics, or warehouse operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2823&quot; data-end=&quot;2881&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2825&quot; data-end=&quot;2881&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Google Sheets or other digital tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2882&quot; data-end=&quot;2932&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2884&quot; data-end=&quot;2932&quot;&gt;Ability to drive manual transmission vehicles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2934&quot; data-end=&quot;2968&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2934&quot; data-end=&quot;2966&quot;&gt;Why You’ll Love It at Clutch:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2970&quot; data-end=&quot;3328&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2970&quot; data-end=&quot;3067&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2972&quot; data-end=&quot;3067&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2972&quot; data-end=&quot;2996&quot;&gt;Autonomy &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; – play a key role in ensuring vehicles meet Clutch’s high standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3068&quot; data-end=&quot;3149&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3070&quot; data-end=&quot;3149&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3070&quot; data-end=&quot;3087&quot;&gt;Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt; – opportunities to develop skills in automotive operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3150&quot; data-end=&quot;3252&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3152&quot; data-end=&quot;3252&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3152&quot; data-end=&quot;3172&quot;&gt;Team Environment&lt;/strong&gt; – collaborate with passionate colleagues committed to quality and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3253&quot; data-end=&quot;3328&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3255&quot; data-end=&quot;3328&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3255&quot; data-end=&quot;3283&quot;&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt; – hourly wage with overtime opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3330&quot; data-end=&quot;3351&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3330&quot; data-end=&quot;3349&quot;&gt;Employment Type&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3353&quot; data-end=&quot;3376&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3353&quot; data-end=&quot;3376&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3355&quot; data-end=&quot;3376&quot;&gt;Existing, Permanent Full-Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3378&quot; data-end=&quot;3407&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3378&quot; data-end=&quot;3405&quot;&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3409&quot; data-end=&quot;3492&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3409&quot; data-end=&quot;3436&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3411&quot; data-end=&quot;3436&quot;&gt;Wage: $20.00 per hour&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3437&quot; data-end=&quot;3463&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3439&quot; data-end=&quot;3463&quot;&gt;Overtime opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3464&quot; data-end=&quot;3492&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3466&quot; data-end=&quot;3492&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; dental benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3494&quot; data-end=&quot;3708&quot;&gt;Clutch is committed to fostering an inclusive workplace where all individuals have an opportunity to succeed. If you require accommodation at any stage of the interview process, please email &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3685&quot; data-end=&quot;3705&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:talent@clutch.ca&quot;&gt;talent@clutch.ca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
